# Jobber API credentials
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Copy this file to a file named  .Renviron  in this same folder.
# 2. Paste your app's values from https://developer.getjobber.com (Manage Apps).
# 3. Restart R (Session -> Restart R in RStudio) so it reads them.
#
# .Renviron is in .gitignore - it never goes to GitHub or Railway.
# Do not put real values in THIS file; this one is committed as a template.

JOBBER_CLIENT_ID=paste-client-id-here
JOBBER_CLIENT_SECRET=paste-client-secret-here

# Optional: only if Jobber warns that this API version is going out of support
# JOBBER_API_VERSION=2025-04-16
